                },
                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "237536026",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561197998228219",
                            "num_reviews": 18,
                            "playtime_forever": 8269,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 8259,
                            "deck_playtime_at_review": 1116,
                            "last_played": 1792743016
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I haven't played every single Tales of game in the series, far from it, but I've at least dabbled and tried quite a few, and I'm convinced this is very likely the best game this franchise has to offer. It's a really great JRPG with action combat and a great cast of characters. Plot isn't gonna blow minds but it's fun, has tension and stakes, and the character relationships are the highlight. This game supports local co-op which is how I experienced it on consoles the first 2 times I played through it. Highly unusual in the genre but I cannot recommend it enough if you have someone local to play a whole JRPG with.",
